#Player selects >Yes

tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=180,TalkTime=1}] [<Looker> Interesting, interesting... So, has she confided in you?"}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=180,TalkTime=9}] [<Looker> Or did you use some of the brilliant detective skills you learned from my class?"}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=180,TalkTime=19}] [<Looker> You're an approachable person, "},{"selector":"@s"},{"text":", which encourages others to open up to you."}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=180,TalkTime=29}] [<Looker> You know, when I first invited Emma to live here, my intention was to become a guardian to her."}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=180,TalkTime=40}] [<Looker> I promised to do everything for her as a parent would."}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=180,TalkTime=47}] [<Looker> I...I do hope my feelings of responsibility are not burdening her."}]

