tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=181,TalkTime=13}] [<Looker> I was a little worried that living in a strange place and studying all day might be causing her stress..."}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=181,TalkTime=26}] [<Looker> Hah! But my concerns prove untrue."}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=181,TalkTime=33}] [<Looker> It is just like a grim detective such as myself to see mysteries in everything."}]

