tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=185,TalkTime=22}] [<Looker> I was hoping to ask her to watch the office for me today, and once again, nowhere can she be found."}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=185,TalkTime=33}] [<Looker> It even seems as if she did not return here last night..."}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=185,TalkTime=40}] [<Looker> Her friends from the former gang seem to be on the straight and narrow,"}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=185,TalkTime=48}] [<Looker> so I hope this is not anything bad, but..."}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=185,TalkTime=56}] [<Looker> Hm? What's this? A Holo Caster clip?"}]

