#Dialogue273
#Ribbon Tourist Wednesday
#/tedit add INTERACT /scoreboard players set @pl DialogueTrigger 273

tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=273,TalkTime=1}] {"text":"<Tourist> I put on a little weight, and now I'm feeling down..."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=273,TalkTime=10}] {"text":"<Tourist> Well, I suppose you can't start feeling better without feeling sad first."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=273,TalkTime=20}] {"text":"<Tourist> Here--I'll give you a Downcast Ribbon!"}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=273,TalkTime=27}] {"text":"<Tourist> Send out your Pokémon and I'll pin a ribbon on them!"}

