tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=274,TalkTime=1}] {"text":"<Tourist> It's easy to drag your feet when you're feeling depressed..."}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=274,TalkTime=10}] {"text":"<Tourist> In times like that, one look at a Downcast Ribbon will surely put a little spring into your step!"}

